.TH TBTOOLS 1 "September 2026" "tbtools-cli v1.0.0" "TBtools-II CLI"
.SH NAME
tbtools \- TBtools-II full-featured command line wrapper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tbtools
.RI [ command ] [ args... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
TBtools-cli wraps all TBtools-II (v2.535+) functionality into command line:
140 plotting/analysis commands + 82 CLI tools + 188 RPC data methods + universal engine reflection.
All engines run headlessly (via xvfb on Linux/WSL), no GUI needed.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B version
Display version, Java, and JAR info.
.TP
.B doctor
Environment diagnosis: checks Java, javac, xvfb-run, JAR, and optional dependencies.
.TP
.B examples [\fIcommand\fR]
Show runnable examples for a command, or list all examples.
.TP
.B help | -h | --help
Show full usage with all commands listed by category.
.TP
.B list \fIplots|tools|rpc|all\fR
List available plotting commands, CLI tools, or RPC methods.
.TP
.B tool \fIname\fR [args...]
Run a CLI tool (82 available: statFasta, rpkmCal, tpmCalc, etc.)
.TP
.B plot \fIcommand\fR [args...]
Run a plotting/analysis engine (140 available: genestructure, volcano, tree, etc.)
.TP
.B rpc \fImethod\fR '\fIjson\fR'
Call an RPC data method (188 available).
.TP
.B engine \fIclass\fR key=value...
Universal engine reflection (any TBtools engine class).
.TP
.B server start | stop
Start/stop the RPC server (port 8765 by default).
.SH PLOTTING CATEGORIES
.TP
Gene structure / Motif / Sequence
genestructure, motif, seqlogo, msa, seqlentrack, cddmotif, pfammotif
.TP
Expression / Statistics
volcano, pca, hclust, qpcr, heatmap2, layoutheatmap, cubeheatmap, groupedbar, violin, dehist
.TP
Phylogeny / Tree
tree, phylotree, unrooted, treeRooting, onesteptree, degramdom
.TP
Genomic location / Circos / Synteny
circos, supercircos, circlegene, dotplot, microsyn, msy, multisyn, dualsyn, pafviz, pafcomp, pafref
.TP
Venn / Sets
venn2, venn3, venn4, venn5, venn6, upset
.TP
ChIP-seq / Others
peaktss, peakdist, peakanno, pileup, gel, gfa, microgenome, virusRecomb, colorscheme, distance, mountain
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B --verbose | -V
Show full Java stack trace on errors (debug mode).
.TP
.B --quiet | -q
Suppress engine progress messages (only show errors).
.SH EXIT CODES
0 = success, 1 = parameter error, 2 = file not found, 3 = data format error
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TBTOOLS_JAR
Path to TBtools_JRE1.6.jar (required).
.TP
.B TBTOOLS_JAVA
Java executable (default: java).
.TP
.B TBTOOLS_RPC_PORT
RPC server port (default: 8765).
.TP
.B TBTOOLS_VERBOSE
Set to 1 for verbose mode (same as --verbose).
.TP
.B TBTOOLS_QUIET
Set to 1 for quiet mode (same as --quiet).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I config/config.sh
Shared configuration (JAR path, Java path, RPC port).
.TP
.I docs/COMMAND_REFERENCE.md
Full command reference (140 commands + 82 tools + 80 bridges + 35 pitfalls).
.TP
.I docs/rpc_methods_reference.md
RPC 188 method reference (params/return values).
.TP
.I run_examples.sh
Quick verification script (8 core features).
.SH BASH COMPLETION
.B source completions/tbtools_completion.bash
.br
Or: cp completions/tbtools_completion.bash ~/.local/share/bash-completion/completions/tbtools
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tbplot.sh (1),
.BR tbtools_rpc.sh (1),
.BR tbengine.sh (1)
